# ── MEDIA DELIVERY ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Set the cloud name and every PHOTOGRAPH on the site is served from Cloudinary
# instead of public/. Leave it unset and everything is served locally exactly
# as before — this is a full rollback, not a degraded mode.
#
# FILM IS NOT AFFECTED BY THIS VARIABLE. The videos are served by Cloudflare
# Pages out of public/videos/ whether or not this is set, because Pages
# bandwidth is free and unmetered while this Cloudinary account is a free tier
# shared with another site. See CLOUDINARY.md for the arithmetic.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* is inlined AT BUILD TIME, so a host needs these as build
# variables, not only runtime ones.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=
# optional; defaults to "maginhawa". The uploader and the two URL builders
# must agree on it or every asset 404s.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLOUDINARY_FOLDER=maginhawa

# ── UPLOADING (scripts/cloudinary-upload.mjs only — never sent to the browser)
# The dashboard hands you one string containing all three:
#   cloudinary://<api_key>:<api_secret>@<cloud_name>
CLOUDINARY_URL=
# …or the three separately:
# CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=
# CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=
# CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=
